  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A CORE CONTRIBUTION TO SUPPORT BIMKOM&#x2019;S 2023 WORK PLAN AND BUDGET FOR THEIR ACTIVITIES IN THE OCCUPIED PALESTINIAN TERRITORY (OPT).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIMKOM is an Israeli-based NGO, which focuses on human rights in planning and land rights issues. Its work focuses on the planning situation for Palestinian communities in Area C and Jerusalem, and the impact of settlement activities and the separation wall on Palestinians. It often provides technical support in legal cases for other human rights NGOs, as well as carrying out studies and assessments on the impact of Israeli settlement policy. Elements of the organisation&#x2019;s work also focus on the provision of WASH type facilities and gender.</narrative>
  </description>
